---
title: "Large Text Cell Editor"
description: "Built-in multi-line text cell editor using the standard HTML textarea element in the $framework Data Grid."
---

Built-in multi-line text cell editor using the standard HTML `textarea`.

## Enabling Large Text Cell Editor

Edit any cell in the grid below to see the Large Text Cell Editor.

{% gridExampleRunner title="Large Text Editor" name="large-text-editor" /%}

Enabled with `agLargeTextCellEditor` and configured with `ILargeTextEditorParams`.

```js
columnDefs: [
    {
        cellEditor: 'agLargeTextCellEditor',
        cellEditorPopup: true,
        cellEditorParams: {
            maxLength: 100
        }
        // ...other props
    }
]
```

## Customisation

### Editor Size

The width and height of the Large Text Cell Editor can be customised. Edit any cell in the grid below to see the editor displayed with a modified size.

{% gridExampleRunner title="Large Text Editor Cols and Rows" name="large-text-editor-cols-rows" /%}

The example above uses the following configuration:

```js
columnDefs: [
    {
        cellEditor: 'agLargeTextCellEditor',
        cellEditorPopup: true,
        cellEditorParams: {
            rows: 15,
            cols: 50
        }
        // ...other props
    }
]
```

-   `cols`: The average number of characters displayed.
-   `rows`: The number of lines of text displayed.

## API Reference

{% interfaceDocumentation interfaceName="ILargeTextEditorParams" names=["maxLength","rows","cols"] /%}
